{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Task: Generate a Premium 3-Column Social Media Section.
    
    1. Layout Architecture:
    
    Create a section featuring a 3-column horizontal grid.
    
    Render exactly 3 identical square or slightly rectangular cards perfectly aligned horizontally side-by-side on desktop.
    
    Mobile Behavior: Strictly force a single-column vertical stack for mobile screens, with generous spacing between the stacked cards.
    
    2. High-End Card Aesthetics:
    
    Background: Pure white cards with a very subtle, light off-white section background to make the cards pop.
    
    Shape: Apply a heavy border-radius (e.g., 24px or 32px) for a smooth, organic feel. Add a hairline, barely visible border (1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.03)).
    
    Depth: Apply a very soft, expansive drop shadow (box-shadow: 0 15px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.04)) to create a luxurious floating effect.
    
    3. Minimalist Content:
    
    Center the content perfectly within each card.
    
    Use highly minimalist, thin-line, monochromatic social media icons (e.g., Instagram, TikTok, WhatsApp). Do not use the default branded colors for the icons; keep them dark grey or black for a unified luxury look.
    
    Include a tiny, elegant, uppercase label below the icon (e.g., "SÍGUENOS EN INSTAGRAM") using a clean Sans-serif font with wide letter-spacing.
    
    4. Micro-Interactions:
    
    Add a fluid hover state (transition: 0.4s cubic-bezier). When hovered, the card should lift slightly (transform: translateY(-8px)) and the shadow should deepen gently to invite interaction., Task: Update the Premium 3-Column Social Media Section (Strictly Horizontal on Mobile).
    
    1. Structural Architecture (Persistent Grid):
    
    Maintain the 3-column horizontal layout (grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr)) across ALL devices, including mobile.
    
    Crucial Mobile Behavior: Strictly disable mobile stacking. The 3 cards MUST remain side-by-side on smartphone viewports.
    
    2. Mobile Spatial Optimization:
    
    Since 3 cards will share the narrow mobile screen width, aggressively reduce the inner padding of the cards for mobile view (e.g., padding: 12px 8px).
    
    Scale down the social media icons appropriately so they remain visually balanced and do not overflow the card edges on smaller screens.
    
    3. High-End Aesthetics & Typography:
    
    Cards: Pure white background, rounded corners (e.g., 16px to 20px for mobile), and a soft, elegant floating drop shadow (box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.05)).
    
    Icons: Use minimalist, thin-line, pure black or dark grey icons for Instagram, TikTok, and WhatsApp.
    
    Text: The label below the icon (e.g., "INSTAGRAM") must be uppercase, clean Sans-serif. On mobile, reduce the font size to 9px or 10px with wide letter-spacing to ensure it stays strictly on one line without wrapping.
    
    4. Micro-Interactions:
    
    Include a smooth hover lift effect for desktop view to maintain the luxurious feel.
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}

{% style %}
  .ai-social-section-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    padding: {{ block.settings.section_padding_top }}px 20px {{ block.settings.section_padding_bottom }}px;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.section_background }};
  }

  .ai-social-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: {{ block.settings.card_gap }}px;
    max-width: {{ block.settings.max_width }}px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .ai-social-card-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    background-color: {{ block.settings.card_background }};
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.card_border_radius }}px;
    border: 1px solid {{ block.settings.card_border_color }};
    box-shadow: {{ block.settings.card_shadow }};
    padding: {{ block.settings.card_padding_desktop }}px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    text-align: center;
    transition: all 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.25, 0.46, 0.45, 0.94);
    aspect-ratio: 1 / 1;
  }

  .ai-social-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover {
    transform: translateY(-8px);
    box-shadow: {{ block.settings.card_shadow_hover }};
  }

  .ai-social-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: {{ block.settings.icon_size_desktop }}px;
    height: {{ block.settings.icon_size_desktop }}px;
    margin-bottom: {{ block.settings.icon_spacing }}px;
    color: {{ block.settings.icon_color }};
  }

  .ai-social-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }} svg {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    stroke-width: 1.5;
  }

  .ai-social-label-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-family: sans-serif;
    font-size: {{ block.settings.label_size_desktop }}px;
    font-weight: 400;
    letter-spacing: {{ block.settings.label_letter_spacing }}em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: {{ block.settings.label_color }};
    line-height: 1.2;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .ai-social-link-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    text-decoration: none;
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 749px) {
    .ai-social-section-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      padding: {{ block.settings.section_padding_top_mobile }}px 12px {{ block.settings.section_padding_bottom_mobile }}px;
    }

    .ai-social-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      gap: {{ block.settings.card_gap_mobile }}px;
    }

    .ai-social-card-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      padding: {{ block.settings.card_padding_mobile }}px;
      border-radius: {{ block.settings.card_border_radius_mobile }}px;
    }

    .ai-social-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      width: {{ block.settings.icon_size_mobile }}px;
      height: {{ block.settings.icon_size_mobile }}px;
      margin-bottom: {{ block.settings.icon_spacing_mobile }}px;
    }

    .ai-social-label-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.label_size_mobile }}px;
    }
  }
{% endstyle %}

<div class="ai-social-section-{{ ai_gen_id }}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
  <div class="ai-social-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
    {% if block.settings.instagram_enabled %}
      <div class="ai-social-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        {% if block.settings.instagram_url != blank %}
          <a href="{{ block.settings.instagram_url }}" class="ai-social-link-{{ ai_gen_id }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="{{ block.settings.instagram_label }}">
        {% endif %}
            <div class="ai-social-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                <rect x="2" y="2" width="20" height="20" rx="5" ry="5"></rect>
                <path d="M16 11.37A4 4 0 1 1 12.63 8 4 4 0 0 1 16 11.37z"></path>
                <line x1="17.5" y1="6.5" x2="17.51" y2="6.5"></line>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <div class="ai-social-label-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.instagram_label }}</div>
        {% if block.settings.instagram_url != blank %}
          </a>
        {% endif %}
      </div>
    {% endif %}

    {% if block.settings.tiktok_enabled %}
      <div class="ai-social-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        {% if block.settings.tiktok_url != blank %}
          <a href="{{ block.settings.tiktok_url }}" class="ai-social-link-{{ ai_gen_id }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="{{ block.settings.tiktok_label }}">
        {% endif %}
            <div class="ai-social-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                <path d="M9 12a4 4 0 1 0 4 4V4a5 5 0 0 0 5 5"></path>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <div class="ai-social-label-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.tiktok_label }}</div>
        {% if block.settings.tiktok_url != blank %}
          </a>
        {% endif %}
      </div>
    {% endif %}

    {% if block.settings.whatsapp_enabled %}
      <div class="ai-social-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        {% if block.settings.whatsapp_url != blank %}
          <a href="{{ block.settings.whatsapp_url }}" class="ai-social-link-{{ ai_gen_id }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="{{ block.settings.whatsapp_label }}">
        {% endif %}
            <div class="ai-social-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                <path d="M21 11.5a8.38 8.38 0 0 1-.9 3.8 8.5 8.5 0 0 1-7.6 4.7 8.38 8.38 0 0 1-3.8-.9L3 21l1.9-5.7a8.38 8.38 0 0 1-.9-3.8 8.5 8.5 0 0 1 4.7-7.6 8.38 8.38 0 0 1 3.8-.9h.5a8.48 8.48 0 0 1 8 8v.5z"></path>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <div class="ai-social-label-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.whatsapp_label }}</div>
        {% if block.settings.whatsapp_url != blank %}
          </a>
        {% endif %}
      </div>
    {% endif %}
  </div>
</div>

